#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM:</font></b> Manage your customer "
"relationships and pipelines."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM:</font></b> Administrér dine "
"kundeforhold og salgspipelines."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Project:</font></b> Build your project "
"foundation for prototyping and reuse it for all subsequent stages."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Projekt:</font></b> Læg fundamentet for "
"dit projekt med henblik på prototyping, og genbrug det i alle efterfølgende "
"faser."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchase:</font></b> Track supplier orders"
" and manage your entire procurement history."
msgstr ""
"<b><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Indkøb:</font></b> Følg leverandørordrer, "
"og administrér hele din indkøbshistorik."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Audit Trail:</b> Keep every modification visible to ensure full "
"transparency throughout the product's development cycle."
msgstr ""
"<b>Revisionsspor:</b> Sørg for, at alle ændringer er synlige for at sikre "
"fuld gennemsigtighed gennem hele produktets udviklingscyklus."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automated MTO (Make to Order):</b> Enable the <b>MTO route</b> on semi-"
"finished products. This automatically triggers a linked secondary MO the "
"moment the main manufacturing order is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"<b>Automatiseret ordrefremstilling:</b> Aktivér <b>ruten til "
"ordrefremstilling</b> for halvfabrikata. Dette udløser automatisk en "
"tilknyttet sekundær produktionsordre, så snart hovedproduktionsordren "
"bekræftes."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>BOM Integration:</b> If your project requires multiple Bills of Materials"
" (BOMs), create them directly using the dedicated BOM button."
msgstr ""
"<b>Integration af styklister:</b> Hvis dit projekt kræver flere styklister, "
"kan du oprette dem direkte via den dertil beregnede styklisteknap."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Batch Sizes:</b> Optimize production runs."
msgstr "<b>Partistørrelser:</b> Optimér produktionskørslerne."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>By-Products:</b> Manage secondary outputs during the manufacturing "
"process."
msgstr "<b>Biprodukter:</b> Administrér biprodukter under produktionen."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>By-products:</b> Manage leftovers from production and track them as "
"valuable inventory."
msgstr ""
"<b>Biprodukter:</b> Administrér produktionsrester, og hold styr på dem som "
"en værdifuld lagerbeholdning."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralized Hub:</b> Use the top menu to navigate effortlessly between "
"all elements linked to your project."
msgstr ""
"<b>Centralt kontaktpunkt:</b> Brug hovedmenuen til nemt at navigere mellem "
"alle de elementer, der er knyttet til dit projekt."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralized Updates:</b> Manage all changes and approvals within a "
"single, dedicated interface."
msgstr ""
"<b>Centrale opdateringer:</b> Administrér alle ændringer og godkendelser via "
"en enkelt, dedikeret brugergrænseflade."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Client Collaboration:</b> Share specific folders with your clients, "
"providing them with a secure, central location to upload and access vital "
"project files."
msgstr ""
"<b>Samarbejde med kunder:</b> Giv dine kunder adgang til bestemte mapper, og "
"giv dem dermed et sikkert, centralt sted, hvor de kan uploade og hente "
"vigtige projektfiler."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> All billable, non-tangible offerings provided to the "
"client."
msgstr ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Alle afregningsberettigede, immaterielle ydelser, der "
"stilles til rådighed for kunden."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> All components and materials sourced directly from "
"external vendors."
msgstr ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Alle komponenter og materialer stammer direkte fra "
"eksterne leverandører."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> In-house manufactured items used as sub-assemblies for "
"larger builds rather than being sold individually."
msgstr ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Internt fremstillede artikler, der anvendes som "
"komponenter i større konstruktioner i stedet for at blive solgt enkeltvis."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Sale-ready goods ranging from standardized items (fixed "
"BOMs) to fully customized solutions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Definition:</b> Salgsfærdige varer, der spænder fra standardiserede "
"artikler (faste styklister) til fuldstændigt skræddersyede løsninger."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Detailed Work Orders:</b> For every operation, you can define precise "
"timings, step-by-step instructions, and mandatory <b>Quality Checks</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Detaljerede arbejdsopgaver:</b> For hvert trin i arbejdsforløbet kan du "
"angive præcise tidsangivelser, trin-for-trin-vejledninger og obligatoriske "
"<b>kvalitetskontroller</b>."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Direct Manufacturing:</b> Launch Manufacturing Orders (MOs) from the "
"Manufacturing tab. Once confirmed, these will flow into your standard "
"manufacturing workflow. (see next section)"
msgstr ""
"<b>Direkte produktion:</b> Start produktionsordrer via fanen \"Produktion\". "
"Efter bekræftelsen indgår disse i din standardproduktionsworkflow. (se næste "
"afsnit)"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Easy Billing:</b> Generate a <b>Sales Order</b> directly from the repair "
"order to invoice your client for parts and labor."
msgstr ""
"<b>Enkel fakturering:</b> Opret en <b>salgsordre</b> direkte fra "
"reparationsordren for at fakturere din kunde for reservedele og arbejdsløn."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Either create a project :</b> From the CRM, create a new project by "
"clicking the <b>⚙️ icon</b> and selecting a template. This project will "
"allow you to manage all the pre-sales steps, such as:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Eller opret et projekt:</b> Opret et nyt projekt i CRM ved at klikke på "
"<b>ikonet ⚙️</b> og vælge en skabelon. Med dette projekt kan du administrere "
"alle trin i forsalget, for eksempel:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Either you create a Quotation from the opportunity and wait for a "
"confirmation.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Du kan enten oprette et tilbud ud fra salgsmuligheden og vente på en "
"bekræftelse.</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Engineering Review:</b> This proposal automatically generates an "
"<b>ECO</b> in the PLM app. Engineers can then review, test, and approve the "
"change before it is officially applied to the Bill of Materials."
msgstr ""
"<b>Teknisk gennemgang:</b> Dette forslag genererer automatisk en <b>teknisk "
"ændringsordre</b> i PLM-appen. Ingeniører kan derefter gennemgå, teste og "
"godkende ændringen, inden den officielt indgår i styklisten."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Financial Forecasting &amp; Actuals:</b> Compare estimated costs against "
"real costs directly from the project overview to maintain control over your "
"budget."
msgstr ""
"<b>Finansielle prognoser og faktiske tal:</b> Sammenlign de anslåede "
"omkostninger med de faktiske omkostninger direkte fra projektoversigten, så "
"du kan bevare kontrollen over dit budget."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Flexible Timesheets:</b> Log time on individual tasks to monitor project "
"profitability or accurately bill clients for hours worked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fleksibel tidsregistrering:</b> Registrér arbejdstiden for de enkelte "
"opgaver for at overvåge projekters rentabilitet eller for at kunne fakturere "
"kunderne præcist for de udførte arbejdstimer."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>For example:</b> A client requests a specialized scanner capable of "
"multilingual package recognition. Within a single project, you can "
"centralize product specifications, vendor quotes, and BOM designs. You can "
"then generate an initial quotation for a <b>Proof of Concept (PoC)</b> "
"directly from the project. Once confirmed, you can continue iterating within"
" the same project—creating updated quotations and Manufacturing Orders by "
"building on previous data and new insights."
msgstr ""
"<b>Eksempel:</b> En kunde forespørger på en specialscanner, der kan genkende "
"emballage på flere sprog. Inden for et enkelt projekt kan du samle "
"produktspecifikationer, tilbud fra leverandører og udkast til styklister på "
"ét sted. Derefter kan du direkte fra projektet udarbejde et første tilbud på "
"en <b>Proof of Concept (PoC)</b>. Efter bekræftelsen kan du fortsætte "
"arbejdet i det samme projekt – og udarbejde opdaterede tilbud og "
"produktionsordrer på baggrund af tidligere data og nye indsigter."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoice Oversight:</b> Track all related outgoing and incoming invoices "
"directly within the project interface."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fakturaoversigt:</b> Følg alle tilhørende indgående og udgående fakturaer "
"direkte i projektgrænsefladen."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Key Benefits:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Vigtigste fordele:</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>MTO (Make-to-Order) Route:</b> Use this to automatically trigger a "
"Manufacturing Order whenever a Sales Order is confirmed"
msgstr ""
"<b>\"Produktionsordrerute\":</b> Brug denne funktion til automatisk at "
"udløse en produktionsordre, så snart en salgsordre bekræftes"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Make to Stock (Reordering Rules):</b> Set a <b>minimum stock level</b> "
"for your sub-assemblies. The system will automatically trigger a new MO once"
" your inventory drops below this threshold, ensuring you always have enough "
"stock on hand for future production."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lagerproduktion (regler for genbestilling):</b> Fastlæg en <b>"
"minimumslagerværdi</b> for dine underenheder. Systemet udløser automatisk en "
"ny produktionsordre, så snart dit lager falder under denne tærskelværdi, for "
"at sikre, at du altid har tilstrækkeligt lager til den fremtidige produktion."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manual Creation:</b> Generate secondary MOs for sub-assemblies manually "
"as the need arises."
msgstr ""
"<b>Manuel oprettelse:</b> Opret om nødvendigt manuelt sekundære "
"produktionsordrer for underenheder."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Miscellaneous Notes &amp; Integration:</b> Use the HTML field (note) in "
"the <b>Miscellaneous tab</b> for advanced instructions. You can embed links "
"to internal knowledge articles, 3D plans, or external software. Operators "
"can access these links directly from the <b>Shopfloor App</b> during "
"production."
msgstr ""
"<b>Forskellige bemærkninger og integration:</b> Brug HTML-feltet "
"(bemærkning) under <b>fanen \"Andet\"</b> til uddybende instruktioner. Du "
"kan indsætte links til interne artikler i vidensdatabasen, 3D-tegninger "
"eller ekstern software. Operatører kan under produktionen få direkte adgang "
"til disse links via <b>Værkstedsappen</b>."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Monitor Progress:</b> Visit the <b>Overview Tab</b> to see a side-by-side"
" comparison of your sales, expected costs, and real costs (derived from "
"invoices and completed Manufacturing Orders)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Overvåg fremskridt:</b> Gå til <b>fanen \"Oversigt\"</b> for at se en "
"direkte sammenligning af dit salg, de forventede omkostninger og de faktiske "
"omkostninger (baseret på fakturaer og afsluttede produktionsordrer)."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> If you validate a transfer for a partial quantity, the system "
"will automatically create a <b>backorder</b> for the rest of the items."
msgstr ""
"<b>Bemærk:</b> Når du godkender en overførsel for en delmængde, opretter "
"systemet automatisk en <b>restordre</b> for de resterende varer."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Organized File Sharing:</b> Create custom folders (such as \"Internal\" "
"or \"Client-Facing\") via the Documents button."
msgstr ""
"<b>Organiseret fildeling:</b> Opret brugerdefinerede mapper (f.eks. "
"\"Internt\" eller \"Kunderelateret\") via knappen \"Dokumenter\"."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Pro Tip: Real-Time Margin Analysis</b>"
msgstr "<b>Det professionelle tip: Marginanalyse i realtid</b>"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Pro-Tip:</b> You can print and use barcode commands with a scanner to "
"automate and streamline your workflow."
msgstr ""
"<b>Det professionelle tip:</b> Du kan udskrive stregkodekommandoer og bruge "
"dem med en scanner for at automatisere og optimere din arbejdsgang."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Proactive Quality Checks:</b> These are predefined checks (created in the"
" Quality App) that trigger automatically at specific stages of production."
msgstr ""
"<b>Proaktive kvalitetskontroller:</b> Her er der tale om foruddefinerede "
"kontroller (oprettet i Kvalitetsappen), der automatisk udløses i bestemte "
"produktionsfaser."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Propose BOM Updates:</b> If a worker discovers a more efficient method or"
" a necessary adjustment, they can propose adding a new step or component."
msgstr ""
"<b>Foreslå opdateringer af styklister:</b> Hvis en medarbejder opdager en "
"mere effektiv metode eller en nødvendig tilpasning, kan vedkommende foreslå, "
"at der tilføjes et nyt trin eller en ny komponent."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> Develop detailed <b>Bills of Materials (BOMs)</b> that "
"explicitly link components to their respective production stages and "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"<b>Protokol:</b> Udarbejd detaljerede <b>stykklister</b>, der eksplicit "
"knytter komponenterne til deres respektive produktionsfaser og arbejdstrin."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> For new clients or projects, create a <b>unique product "
"entry</b>. Map these to a <b>Master BOM Catalog</b> to pull in reusable "
"templates; this allows for distinct database tracking while leveraging "
"standardized production logic."
msgstr ""
"<b>Protokol:</b> Opret en <b>unik produktpost</b> for nye kunder eller "
"projekter. Tilknyt denne til et <b>hovedstyklistekatalog</b> for at inddrage "
"genanvendelige skabeloner; dette muliggør en entydig sporing i databaserne, "
"samtidig med at der anvendes standardiseret produktionslogik."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Protocol:</b> Maintain up-to-date <b>vendor assignments</b> and "
"<b>purchase pricing</b> to ensure procurement accuracy."
msgstr ""
"<b>Protokoll:</b> Hold <b>leverandørtilknytningerne</b> og <b>"
"indkøbspriserne</b> opdateret for at sikre nøjagtigheden i indkøbsprocessen."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reactive Quality Alerts:</b> If a worker identifies an issue on the fly, "
"they can trigger a <b>Quality Alert</b>. This creates a dedicated task in "
"the Quality App for the quality team to investigate."
msgstr ""
"<b>Reaktive kvalitetsmeddelelser:</b> Hvis en medarbejder pludselig opdager "
"et problem, kan vedkommende udløse en reaktiv <b>kvalitetsmeddelelse</b>. "
"Der oprettes dermed en særlig opgave i kvalitetsappen, som kvalitetsteamet "
"kan undersøge."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
